# This repository stores UTF-8 without BOM and LF line endings, and relies on
# that (see AGENTS.md). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise rewrite every file to CRLF, which is the exact condition that
# destroyed README.md once. Pin LF for everything, in both directions.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let git touch line endings in binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.vcd binary
*.vvp binary
*.bin binary
*.hex binary
*.rom binary
